<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan inflation falls to 0.8 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Moldovan inflation falls to 0.8 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldovan consumer prices fell to 0.8 percent in April from 1.0 percent in March, a report from the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES   April'97 March'97 April'96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change	   +0.8     +1.0     +1.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change    +12.0    +12.0    +26.0</p>
<p>The National Bank expects annual inflation to drop this year to 10 percent from 15.1 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
